{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tainted Pools is a first-person liminal space survival horror game inspired by Backrooms lore. Explore the eerie poolrooms and corridors of Backrooms Level 130, where a stalking entity lurks in the shadows, drawn to every sound you make. Scavenge for resources and survive long enough to find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A lurking threat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The monster moves unseen through the pipes, waiting for a chance to strike. It hears your footsteps, sees your light, and reacts instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/monster.gif?t=1750962732\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stay hidden</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoiding detection is always your best option. Fight only if there\u2019s no other choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/hiding.gif?t=1750962732\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scavenge for items that help you survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With limited inventory space, you\u2019ll need to prioritize the essentials and choose the right tools to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/items.gif?t=1750962732\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Randomized item spawn</strong> \u2013 Resources and items change locations with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hostile entity</strong> \u2013 A terrifying entity hunts you, reacting to your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited saves</strong> \u2013 Saving is only available at the hub room, adding risk to your exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Semi-open world</strong> \u2013 Explore interconnected poolrooms and corridors, choosing your own path.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568550?t=1750962732","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3568550?t=1750962732","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/ee203b2337b5dbf37c214bad71be48d91a03c56d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750962732","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/ee203b2337b5dbf37c214bad71be48d91a03c56d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750962732","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3708820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tainted Pools is a first-person liminal space survival horror game inspired by Backrooms lore. Explore the eerie poolrooms and corridors of Backrooms Level 130, where a stalking entity lurks in the shadows, drawn to every sound you make. Scavenge for resources and survive long enough to find your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A lurking threat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The monster moves unseen through the pipes, waiting for a chance to strike. It hears your footsteps, sees your light, and reacts instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/monster.gif?t=1750962732\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stay hidden</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoiding detection is always your best option. Fight only if there\u2019s no other choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/hiding.gif?t=1750962732\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scavenge for items that help you survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With limited inventory space, you\u2019ll need to prioritize the essentials and choose the right tools to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/extras/items.gif?t=1750962732\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Randomized item spawn</strong> \u2013 Resources and items change locations with each playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hostile entity</strong> \u2013 A terrifying entity hunts you, reacting to your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited saves</strong> \u2013 Saving is only available at the hub room, adding risk to your exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Semi-open world</strong> \u2013 Explore interconnected poolrooms and corridors, choosing your own path.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Stray Fox Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568550/16904d66e6eafa73fae6e0177eb43abe9773dade/header.jpg?t=1750962732","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130964,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130964/movie480.mp4?t=1745589935","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tr